cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper and this software archive."
type: software
title: "Analysis code for: Caenorhabditis elegans HLH-30 has age-dependent effects on the transcriptome and is required for normal progeny number and larval survival under basal growth conditions"
abstract: >-
  Nextflow pipeline and R scripts for the hlh-30(tm1978) RNA-seq study of
  Caenorhabditis elegans at L1, L4, Day 3 and Day 6 of adulthood. The pipeline
  counts reads with featureCounts, removes unwanted variation with RUVSeq, tests
  differential expression with DESeq2, clusters genes and runs the enrichment
  tests. The scripts in posthoc/rz draw the figure panels and build the
  supplementary files. The RNA-seq data are in NCBI GEO under accession GSE354145.
